WEBVTT

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.000
Say Philip Murray.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:32.670
Is there any other kind?

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.560
Not for you, there isn't.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.820
Nothing but the best for Mr. Ricardo.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.780
Thank you.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.040
Lucy, you're so good to me.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.230
You see how easy it is to keep a man happy?

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.090
Why not give your husband a carton of Philip Morris cigarettes?

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.200
Smart move.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.720
He'll love them for their mildness, their smoothness,

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.470
and their wonderful good taste.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.380
And he'll love you, too, for thinking of him.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.000
That's right. Good night, everybody.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.070
And don't forget, call for Philip Morris!
